<title>UK: Deutsche sets warrants on the DTB-BOBL-Future.</title>
<headline>Deutsche sets warrants on the DTB-BOBL-Future.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>DB Capital Markets (Deutschland) has issued eight million American-style call and put warrants, in eight equal tranches, on the DTB-BOBL-Future, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	ISS PRICE</p>
<p> CALL A	  107.0 PCT   0.81 DEM</p>
<p> PUT B	   107.0 PCT   2.90 DEM</p>
<p> CALL C	  105.0 PCT   1.58 DEM</p>
<p> PUT D	   105.0 PCT   1.71 DEM</p>
<p> CALL E	  103.0 PCT   2.75 DEM</p>
<p> PUT F	   103.0 PCT   0.93 DEM</p>
<p> CALL G	  101.0 PCT   4.23 DEM</p>
<p> PUT H	   101.0 PCT   0.47 DEM</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 06.MAR.97-19.FEB.98   PAYDATE	06.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT DDF		   MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  104.91 PCT</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
